.build/
.swiftpm/
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
DerivedData/

# The recorded corpus lives in swift/Fixtures/ and IS committed. It was local-only while the
# scrubber let real content through: multipart request bodies bypassed scrubbing entirely, so
# form fields carrying an address were written verbatim, and link-local IPv6 addresses (which
# embed the interface MAC) and absolute /Users/<name> paths in stack traces were never
# touched. All three are scrubbed now, and the corpus was re-scrubbed and audited before
# being committed. See docs/api/README.md.
#
# If you record against a live server, RE-AUDIT before pushing — the scrubber is a filter, not
# a guarantee, and it has been wrong before.

# Generated chat.db fixtures — rebuild with Tools/chatdb-fixtures.
Tests/ChatDBFixtures/*.db

# Reference implementations, installed locally to generate protocol vectors.
Tools/protocol-vectors/node_modules/
Tools/protocol-vectors/package-lock.json

# The observation probe is a separate package with its own build directory.
Tools/observation-probe/.build/
